{"id":"chatcmpl-c1984962-8757-4b6d-95a8-97e36a277961","object":"chat.completion","created":1795244753,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a localization-first diagnostic strategy: when distinguishing between left/right or anterior/posterior findings on imaging, the agent queries for anatomical landmarks and classic radiologic signs rather than asking directly for the diagnosis. The agent iteratively narrows the differential by confirming specific sign patterns (e.g., spine sign, posterior costophrenic angle involvement) before committing to an answer.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"Localization-before-diagnosis: ask the expert tool to describe anatomical location and laterality of the abnormality first, then map location to the candidate diagnoses.\",\n    \"Sign-based confirmation: query for named radiologic signs (e.g., spine sign, silhouette sign, costophrenic blunting) that discriminate between the competing options.\",\n    \"Iterative narrowing: use each tool response to formulate a more specific follow-up question targeting the remaining ambiguity rather than asking everything at once.\",\n    \"Anatomy-to-option mapping: translate imaging findings (anterior vs posterior, overlapping spine, CP angle) into the option space (right base vs left base) explicitly in the reasoning.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Ask for anatomical location and laterality first, then confirm with named radiologic signs; avoid asking the tool directly for the final diagnosis.\",\n    \"Binary/multiple-choice discrimination\": \"Identify the single feature that most cleanly separates the options (here: anterior vs posterior location) and design queries around that discriminator.\",\n    \"Tool-assisted reasoning\": \"Chain short, targeted expert queries where each answer refines the next question, converging on the answer with explicit mapping back to options.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the finding's anatomical location and laterality (anterior/posterior, left/right) before selecting an option.\",\n    \"Verify at least one classic sign (e.g., spine sign, posterior costophrenic angle blunting) that specifically supports the chosen option over its competitor.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":541,"total_tokens":957,"completion_tokens":416,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":541},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":416}}}